<title>UGANDA: Ugandan shilling unchanged vs dollar.</title>
<headline>Ugandan shilling unchanged vs dollar.</headline>
<dateline>KAMPALA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ugandan shilling was unchanged against the dollar and the pound on Monday on quiet trading, commercial bank dealers said.</p>
<p>The shilling was posted at an average rate of 1070 against the dollar the same as Monday, while against the pound, it was posted at an average of 1760 down from 1730 on Friday.</p>
</text>
